  "notes": "v0.1.73 fixes two music-workflow problems. Paid in-app Chapi music planning is removed from the normal music screen and replaced with no-cost local planning, so an OpenAI key with zero credits no longer stops music drafting. Browser-ChatGPT-created Lyria prompts are now authoritative: pasting a full prompt into the world/theme box auto-syncs it to the Lyria Prompt field, and the exact prompt visible at click time is sent to Lyria for both 30-second and 184-second generation. Regression tests assert that a stale prior prompt is never sent. Standard rehearsal passed 61/61 and the 10-minute extended render rehearsal passed 1/1."
